<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay '96 wheat output up 162 pct to 546,000 T.</title>
<headline>Paraguay '96 wheat output up 162 pct to 546,000 T.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1997-01-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguay's wheat production rose 162 percent in 1996 to a record 546,000 tonnes from 208,000 tonnes in 1995, the Agriculture and Livestock Ministry said on Saturday.</p>
<p>But despite the good crop, producers complained falling prices and slow deliveries were hurting their revenues.</p>
<p>-- Daniela Desantis, Asuncion Newsroom +595 21 444527</p>
</text>
